  "details": "VRCSDK3 2020.04.08.18.51\nI created a car handle with a pickup object in VRCSDK3, but when I hold the pickup object while riding on the VRC_Station, it vibrates when I move.\nIf the speed of movement increases, the pickup object will jump out of range and become uncontrollable. See video.\nhttps://youtu.be/yr7gBS8fr7A\nI selected the \"Immobilize for Vehicle\" option for the moving VRC_Station, but it reverts to \"Immobilize\" at build time.\nworld: https://www.vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4c412f59-dc47-4953-b647-1be876706807",
